This module is an unofficial fan adaptation of the One Piece RPG (d20 system).
"One Piece" is a manga/anime by Eiichiro Oda; all referenced characters,
locations, and lore belong to their respective rights holders. This module
contains no copyrighted material from the One Piece RPG rulebook — it only
provides software infrastructure (UI, settings, runtime adapters) for users
to play the system in Foundry VTT with their own content.

This module is built on top of the dnd5e system for Foundry VTT, which is
licensed under MIT and provides its content under the Wizards of the Coast
SRD 5.1 / SRD 5.2 (CC-BY-4.0).
